      "sourceText": "但是，C 与 C++ 编译器处理函数名称的方式并不完全相同。只要调用跨越了 C 和 C++ 的边界，就应提供一个兼容的接口头文件。",
      "translatedText": "However, C and C++ compilers do not handle function names in exactly the same way\\. Whenever a call crosses the boundary between C and C++, a compatible interface header should be provided\\.",
