    "d51beb5d5c91531e97e984522faf4f0c05c6f279edc3a12bcedfb4d1609fba90": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "713ea9c62afe68c8ab229e6e805e6efb0511c11359a719dbd8b869604843307b",
      "contextFingerprint": "bfd70c14a1eebce83133278a8e18c712edad68c87fede2a553a2c45b74cf23e1",
      "sourceText": "这种赋值方式首先将需要存入Mat类中的变量存入一个数组中，之后通过设置Mat类矩阵的尺寸和通道数将数组变量拆分成矩阵，这种拆分方式可以自由定义矩阵的通道数。当矩阵中的元素数目大于数组中的数据时，将用1.0737418e+08填充赋值给矩阵；当矩阵中元素的数目小于数组中的数据时，将矩阵赋值完成后，数组中剩余数据将不再赋值。由数组赋值给矩阵的过程是首先将矩阵中第一个元素的所有通道依次赋值，之后再赋值下一个元素。为了更好地体会这个过程，我们将定义的b和c矩阵在图2-4中给出。",
      "translatedText": "This assignment method first stores the variables to be stored in the Mat class into an array, and then splits the array variables into a matrix by setting the size and number of channels of the Mat class matrix\\. This splitting method can freely define the number of channels of the matrix\\. When the number of elements in the matrix is greater than the data in the array, 1\\.0737418e+08 will be used to fill and assign to the matrix; when the number of elements in the matrix is less than the data in the array, after the matrix assignment is completed, the remaining data in the array will no longer be assigned\\. The process of assigning from an array to a matrix is to first assign all channels of the first element in the matrix in sequence, and then assign the next element\\. To better understand this process, the b and c matrices we defined are given in Figure 2\\-4\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 267,
        "outputTokens": 196,
        "costUsd": 0.000316
      }
    },
